<title>UK: London precious metals close mainly off, silver up.</title>
<headline>London precious metals close mainly off, silver up.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Finished at $324.70/$325.20 vs $326.40/$326.90. Eased to lower end of range late after steady AM. No help from U.S. economic data.</p>
<p>SILVER - Closed up five cents at $4.42/$4.42. Added to early gains as locals triggered Comex stops.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Off high at $426.50/$429.50 down $0.50.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Ended at $205.20/$208.20, down $1.50.</p>
</text>
